(B-C) & =A+B-C-B+C \\\\  & =A+\\cancel{B}-\\cancel{C}-\\cancel{B}+\\cancel{C} \\\\  & =A\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single matrix. So, the result is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 9 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186520629 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "49d19e7a-0fc0-50ae-b3a5-9c01e5c65e97" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 9 \\\\ 4 & 8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186520631} {:answer/id #uuid "621dc59c-8142-5f34-8aab-42e79cf5e4df" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 7\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186520633} {:answer/id #uuid "9e1ea837-d10d-5bf2-bae0-976fc4dfcd74" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 9 \\\\ 9 & 8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186520643} {:answer/id #uuid "c231fbd5-89c5-57ce-adea-5e655042edde" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186520648} {:answer/id #uuid "edc57f90-16d2-5a50-bedc-d6765bd98552" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186520654}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "49d19e7a-0fc0-50ae-b3a5-9c01e5c65e97" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 9 \\\\ 4 & 8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186520631} :answer-field/id #uuid "30efad40-769c-578b-9a61-fa83315a0cb3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186520627}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "42dda2aa-e167-58bd-aa6f-bd2c1644c26e" :question/problem "Find $(A+B)-C-(B-C)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 9 \\\\ 4 & 8\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix